  "slug": "ballad-of-john-and-yoko-photo-session",
  "title": "The Ballad Of John And Yoko photo session | 1969",
  "date": "1969-04-30",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a> and <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> recorded The Beatles’ single <a href=\"/songs/the-ballad-of-john-and-yoko/\">‘The Ballad Of John And Yoko’</a> on <a href=\"/1969/04/14/recording-mixing-the-ballad-of-john-and-yoko/\">14 April 1969</a>. Its b-side, <a href=\"/songs/old-brown-shoe/\">‘Old Brown Shoe’</a>, was recorded on <a href=\"/1969/04/16/recording-mixing-old-brown-shoe-something/\">16</a> and <a href=\"/1969/04/18/recording-mixing-old-brown-shoe-i-want-you-shes-so-heavy/\">18 April</a>. <span id=\"more-125466\"></span></p><p>The songs were selected as the band’s next single, and a photography session was convened for the sleeve art.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1969-photos/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-125477\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"125477\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"557,930\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles and Yoko Ono, 30 April 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles and Yoko Ono, 30 April 1969\" width=\"557\" height=\"930\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-125477\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08.jpg 557w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08-347x580.jpg 347w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_08-120x200.jpg 120w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 557px) 100vw, 557px\"></a></p><p>The shoot took place in the garden of McCartney’s London home, 7 Cavendish Avenue. The Beatles and <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a> were all present. The principal photographer was <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda McCartney</a>, although the band’s assistant <a href=\"/people/mal-evans/\">Mal Evans</a> also took some side-on images.</p><p>The precise date was unknown for many years, but on 30 April 2020 the Linda McCartney Instagram account uploaded a <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/stories/highlights/17903134282443513/\">story post</a> confirming that the shoot happened on that day 51 years previously.</p><p><a href=\"/1969/04/30/ballad-of-john-and-yoko-photo-session/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-125467\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0ODQiIGhlaWdodD0iODY1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNDg0IDg2NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"125467\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/04/30/ballad-of-john-and-yoko-photo-session/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"484,865\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Linda McCartney Instagram post&nbsp;–&nbsp;The Ballad Of John And Yoko\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01.jpg\" alt=\"Linda McCartney Instagram post&nbsp;–&nbsp;The Ballad Of John And Yoko\" width=\"484\" height=\"865\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-125467\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01.jpg 484w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01-325x580.jpg 325w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/linda-mccartney-instagram-ballad-of-john-and-yoko_01-112x200.jpg 112w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 484px) 100vw, 484px\"></a></p><blockquote><div>When I did take pictures it was just for myself. I could have pushed to be the stills photographer on <em>Let It Be</em>, but I never thought about it. In fact, the only time I did an official Beatles photo was when Paul called me up at the last minute from the studio, and said that EMI needed a cover for the sleeve of ‘The Ballad Of John And Yoko’. I took a color portrait of the group with Yoko. I had really wanted The Beatles on their own, but Yoko just sat there, and being a timid newcomer I simply didn’t have the heart to tell her it was group members only.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Linda McCartney<br>\n<em>Sixties</em></div><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/04/30/ballad-of-john-and-yoko-photo-session/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-125466 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxMjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTIwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_05-120x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles and Yoko Ono, 30 April 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_05-120x200.jpg 120w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690430-beatles-yoko-ono_05-349x580.jpg 349w, https://www.beatlesbi